  "articleBody": "An accessible bathroom remodel should make bathing, toileting, and handwashing safer and easier for the people who use the room now and may use it later. The right plan considers door clearance, shower entry, grab-bar reinforcement, fixture reach, lighting, flooring, plumbing, electrical work, and the existing layout before construction begins.",
